{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u73a9\u5bb6\u4ea4\u6d41QQ\uff1a300723397</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u262a Introduction \u262a</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Transparent Her and Real Me&quot; is a multi-character, multi-ending &quot;super long&quot; bishoujo game developed and published by Kuwei Studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u262a Game Features \u262a</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 2 Playable Heroine Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 Full Voice Acting for All Characters Throughout the Entire Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 Full Live2D Animation Performance</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 Over One Million Words of Script, Over 100 CGs</strong> (This total does not include variations)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7high-quality and melodious original music</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 Unique &quot;Real-time Dialogue System&quot; Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u262a Story Origin \u262a</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins in a small, sunless room in Hucheng.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I,&quot; who has been a shut-in obsessed with the second dimension and on leave from school for a year,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >decide to return to university life under the meticulous care of my guardian sister, Shimeng.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl who should have been just another passerby to me</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unexpectedly appeared before my eyes\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CG! I saw a CG!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thus, in a world that should have been for &quot;two people,&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a &quot;three-person&quot; romantic comedy unfolds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021350/extras/f192c8bf1164351411e228becd6ef58a.avif?t=1772044632\" width=600 height=150 /></span>Your sister and guardian, a genius honor student at Hucheng's top girls' high school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skilled in cooking and fashion. Although she often bickers with you, she always takes care of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since &quot;that time,&quot; she has vowed to become strong and excellent enough to protect you, who was once deeply hurt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026\u2026&quot;There is nothing that can separate us again. I won't allow such a thing to exist.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021350/extras/26425963549bf92d1697731bd49fd23f.avif?t=1772044632\" width=600 height=150 /></span>The first female friend you made other than your sister, a journalism student at Hucheng Normal University.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle and introverted, she blushes easily. Currently working part-time at holyfiremeow club to support herself and pursue her dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passionate about bishoujo and otome games, she can easily detect your level of obsession with the second dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026\u2026&quot;The world lights up its faded stars for its children.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026\u2026&quot;Like the vibrant colors dancing on the dome, singing the elegy of dawn to the night.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021350/extras/dff3bf99ba1d8fcf7c1d96c111b46746.avif?t=1772044632\" width=600 height=150 /></span>Shimeng's classmate and friend, who has a bit of a chuunibyou complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026\u2026&quot;I... I, of course, deeply love my servant!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021350/extras/5e973c4b91ae509d3576e47e7a5112d5.avif?t=1772044632\" width=600 height=150 /></span>Shimeng's classmate and friend, who seems to have an indescribable relationship with Xiaobing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026\u2026&quot;Even if you are her brother, I won't go easy on you~&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stage Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021350/extras/c0751e1948de2e70c3c7e7195aab0cb5.avif?t=1772044632\" width=600 height=169 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021350/extras/a1666fcb9fdf1d8c72e9691b0649abe5.avif?t=1772044632\" width=600 height=169 /></span>Filmed on location, recreating the most authentic &quot;Hucheng&quot; scenery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations include but are not limited to North Bund, Lujiazui, Shanghai Jiao Tong University,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shanghai No. 3 Girls' High School, and Shanghai's &quot;Akihabara.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021350/extras/ce77d8cf009c73e1e72251f21aeb36b3.poster.avif?t=1772044632\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021350/extras/ce77d8cf009c73e1e72251f21aeb36b3.webm?t=1772044632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021350/extras/ce77d8cf009c73e1e72251f21aeb36b3.mp4?t=1772044632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>\u00b7 Live2D Performance</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All CG and character sprites are implemented with Live2D, ushering in the next era of bishoujo games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021350/extras/3847e703b31838c9c4ef231ea40fe7c3.avif?t=1772044632\" width=600 height=168 /></span><strong>\u00b7 Customizable Name</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist's name is decided by you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(*Shimeng will inherit the player's custom surname)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021350/extras/b72c2a24a53e3da4b281819a97cc6a8b.avif?t=1772044632\" width=600 height=168 /></span><strong>\u00b7 Real-time Dialogue</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's impolite to stay silent when talking with a bishoujo, a romance adventure is more than just simple choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021350/extras/a624bef6588fe3e8a4a00934c35afb71.avif?t=1772044632\" width=600 height=168 /></span><strong>\u00b7 Phone Interaction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three people but four group chats? Connections through the internet, cherish this bond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer: All characters in this game are over 18 years old at the time of the game's events.</strong></p>","achiev