nce</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 Over One Million Words of Script, Over 100 CGs</strong> (This total does not include variations)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7high-quality and melodious original music</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 Unique &quot;Real-time Dialogue System&quot; Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u262a Story Origin \u262a</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins in a small, sunless room in Hucheng.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I,&quot; who has been a shut-in obsessed with the second dimension and on leave from school for a year,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >decide to return to university life under the meticulous care of my guardian sister, Shimeng.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl who should have been just another passerby to me</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unexpectedly appeared before my eyes\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CG! I saw a CG!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thus, in a world that should have been for &quot;two people,&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a &quot;three-person&quot; romantic comedy unfolds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021350/extras/f192c8bf1164351411e228becd6ef58a.avif?t=1772044632\" width=600 height=150 /></span>Your sister and guardian, a genius honor student at Hucheng's top girls' high school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skilled in cooking and fashion. Although she often bickers with you, she always takes care of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since &quot;that time,&quot; she has vowed to become strong and excellent enough to protect you, who was once deeply hurt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026\u2026&quot;There is nothing that can separate us again. I won't allow such a thing to exist.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021350/extras/26425963549bf92d1697731bd49fd23f.avif?t=1772044632\" width=600 height=150 /></span>The first female friend you made other than your sister, a journalism student at Hucheng Normal University.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle and introverted, she blushes easily. Currently working part-time at holyfiremeow club to support herself and pursue her dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passionate about bishoujo and otome games, she can easily detect your level of obsession with the second dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026\u2026&quot;The world lights up its faded stars for its children.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026\u2026&quot;Like the vibrant colors dancing on the dome, singing the elegy of dawn to the night.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021350/extras/dff3bf99ba1d8fcf7c1d96c111b46746.avif?t=1772044632\" width=600 height=150 /></span>Shimeng's classmate and friend, who has a bit of a chuunibyou complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026\u2026&quot;I... I, of course, deeply love my servant!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021350/extras/5e973c4b91ae509d3576e47e7a5112d5.avif?t=1772044632\" width=600 height=150 /></span>Shimeng's classmate and friend, who seems to have an indescribable relationship with Xiaobing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026\u2026&quot;Even if you are her brother, I won't go easy on you~&q