600 height=168 /></span><strong>\u00b7 Customizable Name</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist's name is decided by you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(*Shimeng will inherit the player's custom surname)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021350/extras/b72c2a24a53e3da4b281819a97cc6a8b.avif?t=1772044632\" width=600 height=168 /></span><strong>\u00b7 Real-time Dialogue</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's impolite to stay silent when talking with a bishoujo, a romance adventure is more than just simple choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021350/extras/a624bef6588fe3e8a4a00934c35afb71.avif?t=1772044632\" width=600 height=168 /></span><strong>\u00b7 Phone Interaction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three people but four group chats? Connections through the internet, cherish this bond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer: All characters in this game are over 18 years old at the time of the game's events.</strong></p>","developers":["\u53ef\u5473\u73a9KawayiPlay"],"dlc":[4165820],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021350/header.jpg?t=1772044632","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3021350/733782/df6f6169a3b772c2e32420db1718637eb3804e8b/1750958569/dash_av1.mpd?t=1723220935","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3021350/733782/df6f6169a3b772c2e32420db1718637eb3804e8b/1750958569/dash_h264.mpd?t=1723220935","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tra